   565	    Templated paths such as ``goals/<id>/data-contract.md`` describe a
   566	    *shape* of path, not a literal reference — the leading-character check
   567	    below only catches a span that *starts* with `<`; a placeholder in the
   568	    middle of an otherwise pathish span (e.g. after a real prefix like
   569	    `goals/`) needs its own check.
