  1279	def submodule_roots(project: Path) -> list[Path]:
  1280	    """Every git submodule directory declared in .gitmodules, at any depth.
  1281	
  1282	    Used as extra resolution bases for Rule B citation existence (not for
  1283	    Rule A scope-lock containment). A review may cite a path relative to a
  1284	    submodule's own root (e.g. `plugins/harnessloop/` when `harnessloop` is
  1285	    checked out as a submodule at <project>/harnessloop) rather than
  1286	    relative to the outer project root; without this, such citations are
  1287	    dangling relative to every existing base even though the file exists.
  1288	
  1289	    `.gitmodules` `path =` values are honored verbatim, including nested
  1290	    ones (e.g. `path = kernels/openclaw`) — a submodule need not be
  1291	    checked out directly under the project root. Projects without a
